"The divine spark of luck is instinctive fate magic: it cloaks its bearer in fate."
"The spark's bad luck falls on everybody else around its bearer, not on her."
"The spark of luck pushes its bearer, and maybe those near her, into adventures."
"A fifth-step path can turn the spark of luck into Will of the Black Witch, a skill that bends fate."
"A bearer of a foreign fate can break the chains of fate magic; if once defeated, fate may take her."
